[00:01.08]1. Ever onward, O my people,
[00:04.28]Let the Kingdom tidings go.
[00:07.96]Tremble not before our foe.
[00:11.68]Let all lovers of truth know
[00:15.02]That my reigning Son, Christ Jesus,
[00:19.08]To the earth has cast the foe,
[00:22.74]Soon to bind the Devil, Satan,
[00:26.16]Letting all his victims go.
[00:31.48](Chorus)
[00:31.62]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[00:38.38]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[00:44.62]I will keep my faithful servant
[00:50.06]As the apple of my eye.
[00:58.06]2. Even though your foes are many,
[00:58.84]Though they threaten and revile,
[00:58.86]Though they flatter and they smile,
[00:58.86]To mislead and to beguile.
[00:58.92]Fear them not, my faithful people,
[00:59.16]Nor their persecution’s heat,
[01:24.72]For I will preserve the faithful
[01:28.30]Till the vict’ry is complete.
[01:33.14](Chorus)
[01:34.38]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[01:38.74]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[01:47.13]I will keep my faithful servant
[01:52.08]As the apple of my eye.
[02:00.22]3. Never fear you are forgotten;
[02:03.98]I am still your strength and shield.
[02:08.06]Though you die upon the field,
[02:11.98]Even death to me will yield.
[02:15.84]Fear them not who kill the body
[02:19.06]But cannot destroy the soul.
[02:22.72]To the end may you be faithful;
[02:26.38]I will bring you to your goal!
[02:30.92](Chorus)
[02:31.74]Fear them not, O my beloved,
[02:38.00]Though their boasting threats may fly.
[02:44.82]I will keep my faithful servant
[02:50.06]As the apple of my eye.
